{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the end of days</b> — these are the days of the Messiah, for Jacob hints at this in his words, as he says, \"until Shiloh come, and unto him shall the gathering of the peoples be\" (Genesis 49:10). And our Sages said (Pesachim 56a) that he sought to reveal the End, but the Shekhinah departed from him, for according to everyone's opinion, \"the end of days\" is the days of the Messiah."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:46:39.129272881Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}